<title>UK: Pilkington says to raise glass prices.</title>
<headline>Pilkington says to raise glass prices.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pilkington Plc said on Thursday it would raise the price of glass for its building products by eight percent.</p>
<p>A company spokesman told Reuters in response to a telephone inquiry that the move would take effect from July 1.</p>
<p>The company earlier reported sharply lower 1996/97 pre-tax profits of 132 million stg, which it said had been hurt by fragile prices and weak market conditions in Europe.</p>
</text>
